# POST /imap/provision — step 2: create (or update) the account.
#
# An omitted/empty password GENERATES one and returns it exactly once in
# ._acct.password — only its argon2id hash is stored, so this response is
# the only time anyone sees it. A body that carries `password` stores that
# one instead and nothing comes back. Creating an account creates its
# INBOX.
WHEN ._prov.username != ""
  EXEC "txco://imap/account"
    WITH username = ._prov.username,
         password = ._prov.password,
         into = "_acct"
